		{"id":"f","type":"text","text":"## 阶段 6｜Latest Policy\n- actor 已更新\n- rollout 拿到新权重\n- 下一批采样使用新策略\n- 闭环继续训练","x":770,"y":650,"width":450,"height":330,"color":"4"},
